    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p><i>The toxin of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Spiner_Plant\" title=\"Spiner Plant\">Spiner Plant</a> can dull the senses and impede the natural processes of a living creature.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Plant_Toxin_Statistics_.28CL_8.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plant_Toxin_Statistics_(CL_8)\">Plant Toxin Statistics (CL 8)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Contact, Natural, Poison </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A creature is hit by the attack of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Spiner_Plant\" title=\"Spiner Plant\">Spiner Plant</a>. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +10 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> None </p><p><b>Suggested <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>:</b> The following are suggested <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a> for this Hazard: </p><ul>\n <li><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a></b> <b>(DC 23; Requires <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Medical_Kit\" title=\"Medical Kit\">Medical Kit</a>):</b> The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a> caused by the Plant Toxin is removed.</li>\n</ul>",
